{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c655","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa4d-35aa-7773-97f7-293f4760a2d6"},"sequence":389,"recorded_at":1780531400000773,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a1715be3-1f15-4a95-87f8-c19d8786aea9","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a1715be3-1f15-4a95-87f8-c19d8786aea9","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a1715be3-1f15-4a95-87f8-c19d8786aea9"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa4e-0060-7030-bc8a-342bd7545540"},"task_id":"01a0aa4e-0060-7030-bc8a-342bd7545540","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa4e-0060-7030-bc8a-342bd7545540","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/rev9ev/results-rev8.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-21gygk — rev8 rework outcome (CR8 P1 repaired)\n2|\n3|Authority: AX v0.6.0 (`0cbdf100dbf84df50c64f792b1f940e3a67859a6`).\n4|Candidate: uncommitted Story worktree\n5|`task-board/story/STORY-260830-3tq4ns` (no producer commit; handoff\n6|snapshots the working tree). Base `8cf4aaaa190e6a11dff2661aa6806ce476128653`.\n7|All CI local (darwin/arm64, Go 1.25.5); no hosted CI.\n8|\n9|## What changed\n10|\n11|1. `internal/sessquery/lease.go`: new shared admission\n12|   `checkCheckpointProfileAuthority` (+ `sessionCreationProfile`,\n13|   `profileClosure`, `eventProfilePair`, `eventProfileTarget`,\n14|   `eventPayloadMembers`, `checkClosureProfilePairs`,\n15|   `checkProfilePairSource`, `profilePair`), called after the heads\n16|   gate in `checkWinnerCheckpoint` and `checkCheckpointBinding`, so\n17|   all four entries (`BuildPlan`, fresh and old-plan `Revalidate`,\n18|   `AuthoritativeStatus`, `AuthoritativeList`) admit Section 2.4\n19|   profile authority over the winning-source closure. Semantic\n20|   violations refuse `integrity_failure` (SPEC 5.4); failed reads\n21|   refuse `observation_unavailable` with the cause kept.\n22|2. `internal/sessquery/rev8_regression_test.go` (new): ported\n23|   reviewer probe `TestRev8CheckpointProfileAuthority` plus\n24|   real-change positives, eight refusal classes with the integrity\n25|   class pinned, historical-closure admission, and old-plan\n26|   profile-only substitution.\n27|3. `internal/sessquery/rev7_regression_test.go`: missing/later-head\n28|   refusals pin the `observation_unavailable` class\n29|   (`rev7CheckHeadRefusalClass` + old-plan pin), locking heads-before-\n30|   profile gate order against the new backstop.\n31|4. `internal/sessquery/testdata/mutate.py`: four new narrowing\n32|   plants (`N-profile-first-source`, `N-profile-newest`,\n33|   `N-profile-value`, token-preserving `N-profile-change-direction`).\n34|5. `internal/sessquery/TRACEABILITY.md`, `summary.go`/`lease.go`\n35|   comments, `LOGBOOK.md`: evidence and bounds updated. No product\n36|   behavior outside the assigned selector/plan/summary scope.\n37|\n38|## AC ratio: 8 of 8 rows driven through shared production entries, 8 of 8 established\n39|\n40|Public CLI remains a stated bound (0 of 8 CLI rows delivered by this leaf).\n41|\n42|| Row | Production call and named evidence | Result |\n43|| --- | --- | --- |\n44|| UUID/name | Reader.Resolve; TestResolvePinnedPrecedence, TestResolveBareIdentityUnion | Established (unchanged, suite green) |\n45|| Qualified selectors | Reader.Resolve/resolveExplicit; TestResolveQualifiedSourcesSelectOneIndex, TestResolveQualifiedSourceNeverFallsBack, TestResolveExplicitSourceReadFailures | Established (unchanged, suite green) |\n46|| Ambiguity | Reader.Resolve/matchName/checkRecordAgreement; TestResolveExactNamesAndASCIICollisions, TestResolveBareIdentityUnion | Established (unchanged, suite green) |\n47|| List summaries | Reader.AuthoritativeList/authorize/winningLeaseFor; TestSummaryBootstrapRefusals, TestSummaryMixedListRefusesWhole, TestAuthoritativeAdmitsFullCapabilityRegistry; new TestRev8CheckpointProfileAuthority, TestRev8ProfileSourceRefusals, TestRev8ProfileHistoricalClosureAdmits | Established (P1 closed) |\n48|| Status summaries | Reader.AuthoritativeStatus/authorize/winningLeaseFor; TestAuthoritativeStatusHealthy, TestAuthoritativeMissingProcessRefusesStatus, TestAuthoritativeHostNameBound64; new rev8 suite as above | Established (P1 closed) |\n49|| Stable sorting | Reader.List/Resolve; TestListStatusDerivedFactsAndStableOrder, TestResolvePeerOrderAndReplicatedIdentity | Established (unchanged, suite green) |\n50|| SelectionPlan | Reader.BuildPlan/Revalidate/ParsePlan; TestBuildPlanBindsCurrentFacts, TestRevalidateDetectsEachFactChange, TestValidSuccessorBuildsAndRevalidates, TestRevalidateUnionParkedCopyRefuses, TestRev5/6/7 suites; new rev8 suite + old-plan substitution + fresh-plan revalidation | Established (P1 closed) |\n51|| Negative/refusal | Shared entries above; shipped refusal tests and mutation instrument; new rev8 suite + 4 narrowing plants | Established (P1 closed) |\n52|\n53|## Failing baseline (pre-fix, recorded)\n54|\n55|`.temp/TASK-260830-21gygk/rev8-baseline-red.log` (exit 1): ported\n56|probe on the unmodified candidate — 4 positive controls passed, all\n57|4 missing-source negatives admitted (BuildPlan succeeded, fresh\n58|Revalidate nil, both summaries succeeded).\n59|\n60|## Final validation (real exits, final source)\n61|\n62|- `go build ./...` → 0; `go vet ./...` → 0; `gofmt -l internal/` →\n63|  empty; `git diff --check` → 0.\n64|- `go test ./... -count=1` → 0 (all packages ok; log\n65|  `full-suite-final.log`).\n66|- `go test ./internal/sessquery ./internal/sessrepo -count=1 -cover`\n67|  → 0; sessquery 86.7%, sessrepo 87.2% (`cover-final.log`).\n68|- Focused: `TestRev8*` verbose green (`rev8-final-green.log`);\n69|  `TestRev7*` verbose green incl. class pins (`rev7-final-green.log`).\n70|\n71|## Mutation evidence (same instrument, final Go source)\n72|\n73|Shipped harness `internal/sessquery/testdata/mutate.py` (with the 4\n74|new plants) run as 4 slices on exact final bytes; per-slice\n75|`mutants.json` + raw logs in the evidence bundle. Result: all 59\n76|narrowing/behavioral plants KILLED with named failing tests and\n77|real exit 1; controls `control-before`/`control-after` exit 0;\n78|`C-harmless-comment` SURVIVED applied (exit 0, same instrument);\n79|`C-not-applied` NOT_APPLIED and `C-compile-failure`\n80|COMPILE_OR_HARNESS_FAILURE report separately and are not counted\n81|as kills.\n82|\n83|New plants: `N-profile-first-source` killed by the rev8\n84|missing-source negatives + dangling-resume refusal;\n85|`N-profile-newest` killed by the non-newest refusal +\n86|two-generation control; `N-profile-value` killed by the stale-value\n87|refusal; `N-profile-change-direction` killed by all P1/E1 positive\n88|controls. Affected lease plants re-verified: all 8 KILLED,\n89|including `N-checkpoint-heads` by the missing_head negatives\n90|surfacing the wrong class through the new class pin (the profile\n91|backstop refuses the weakened-heads fixture with integrity_failure;\n92|unmutated heads still fire first with observation_unavailable —\n93|gate order locked, no silent admission in either direction).\n94|\n95|## Stated bounds (no unsupported claims)\n96|\n97|No public CLI surface; no publication/storage/transport/CLI\n98|integration; `fork.created` provenance, resume checkpoint-ID\n99|existence, task-board launch lease-repeat/mode binding,\n100|change-source continuity, and confirmation gating are not\n101|re-derived here per the cited normative sentences (matrix C6b).\n102|A well-formed post-head citation from inside the closure has no\n103|fixture by causal necessity; non-consultation is proven by the\n104|historical control. `lease_record_id` remains absent-nowhere:\n105|bound from the same winning record as before (unchanged).\n106|\n107|## Deliverables for review\n108|\n109|- Candidate: uncommitted worktree diff (product: `lease.go`,\n110|  `summary.go` comment; tests: `rev8_regression_test.go`,\n111|  `rev7_regression_test.go` class pins; harness:\n112|  `testdata/mutate.py`; docs: `TRACEABILITY.md`,