d validated record digest,\\n1885:  refuses `selector_observation_unavailable`; a complete read proving\\n1887:  `selector_bootstrap_incomplete` instead of binding an empty triple.\\n1892:  evidence are `selector_plan_stale` while lagging copies stay\\n1895:  `selector_observation_unavailable` (never evidence, never absence)\\n1913:status refuse it with `selector_bootstrap_incomplete` — the whole list\\n1926:observations refuse `selector_observation_unavailable` while\\n1940:in [the task evidence map](internal/sessquery/TRACEABILITY.md).\\n1943:go test ./internal/sessquery ./internal/sessrepo -count=1 -v\\n1944:python3 internal/sessquery/testdata/mutate.py /absolute/path/to/new/evidence-dir\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1635,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 409,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
