oint-heads, whose kill pins error class/order through the\n+profile backstop rather than semantic admission). The three\n+classifier controls report separately and never join the kill\n+numerator. Measured runs and per-mutant tables are\n+attached on the task, never hard-coded as a green claim here. No\n","final_result":true}}}
